# TypeScript incremental-build cache. Rewritten on every `pnpm build`, so a
# tracked copy shows up as a modified file after any build and lands noise in
# every diff. apps/app already ignored it locally; this covers the workspace so
# apps/store (which has no .gitignore of its own) is caught too.
*.tsbuildinfo

